# Test: SR Policy MPLS label range through `ze show bgp encode`
# VALIDATES: a Binding SID label in the reserved range 0-15 or wider than 20 bits, and a
#            Type A segment label wider than 20 bits, are refused with exit 1 and an
#            error naming the token, the value and the allowed range, and no hex; an
#            in-range route encodes both labels exactly as 0xFFFFF.
# PREVENTS: a configured label being truncated to its low 20 bits, or a reserved
#           Binding SID label being sent (spec-bgp-sr-policy-rfc-defects D2).

# RFC 9830 Section 2.4.2: "The Label field is validated by the SRPM but MUST NOT contain
# the reserved MPLS label values (0-15)."
cmd=foreground:seq=1:exec=ze show bgp encode -f ipv4/sr-policy "next-hop 192.0.2.1 distinguisher 0 color 100 endpoint 10.0.0.1 binding-sid mpls 15"
expect=exit:code=1
expect=stderr:contains=binding-sid mpls 15: labels 0 to 15 are reserved (RFC 9830 Section 2.4.2); use 16 to 1048575
reject=stdout:contains=FFFFFFFFFFFFFFFF

# RFC 3032 Section 2.1: "This 20-bit field carries the actual value of the Label."
cmd=foreground:seq=2:exec=ze show bgp encode -f ipv4/sr-policy "next-hop 192.0.2.1 distinguisher 0 color 100 endpoint 10.0.0.1 binding-sid mpls 1048576"
expect=exit:code=1
expect=stderr:contains=binding-sid mpls 1048576: an MPLS label is 20 bits; use 16 to 1048575
reject=stdout:contains=FFFFFFFFFFFFFFFF

# RFC 9830 Section 2.4.4.2.1: "Label:  20 bits of label value."
cmd=foreground:seq=3:exec=ze show bgp encode -f ipv4/sr-policy "next-hop 192.0.2.1 distinguisher 0 color 100 endpoint 10.0.0.1 segment-list weight 1 segment type-a mpls 1048576"
expect=exit:code=1
expect=stderr:contains=type-a mpls 1048576: an MPLS label is 20 bits; use 0 to 1048575
reject=stdout:contains=FFFFFFFFFFFFFFFF

# In range: both labels are 0xFFFFF in the top 20 bits, TC/S/TTL zero, so the refusals
# above come from the range check and not from a command that cannot encode at all.
cmd=foreground:seq=4:exec=ze show bgp encode -f ipv4/sr-policy "next-hop 192.0.2.1 distinguisher 0 color 100 endpoint 10.0.0.1 binding-sid mpls 1048575 segment-list weight 1 segment type-a mpls 1048575"
expect=exit:code=0
expect=stdout:contains=0D060000FFFFF000
expect=stdout:contains=01060000FFFFF000
